Z||000004||RossT||10-16-2001||11:56 PM||||Scott! you have a new name!!  Jeff and I thought you dropped of the planet..<P>WKAYL should be here sometime Wed.  Not sure when.  I think he needs to get back to Co., so I don't think he plans on staying too long. <P>Yes he did do one more in detail inspection on Monday.  Without even asking the owner of the car said he would have the seat recovered at no cost to me!! Mileage on the Formula is 32,800.  Yes I am finally going to get that daily driver I always wanted, just to bad the cold frozen tundra is almost here. Wkayl could only find one minor chip on the front facia.  Car has new eagle gt2's and everything mechanically is fine.  I will post some pics this week. The onwer even came down in price a little.  I just couldn't pass on this one.  Strange how both of my fiero's came from Denver.<P>Scott.  keep in touch!!  All three of us should get together before the jet stream bends south..||||reg||1
